Package: rmeds
Title: Run the OMOP-to-MEDS ETL and MEDS-DEV Benchmarks from R
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Robin", "van de Water", email = "rpv2114@cumc.columbia.edu",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: An R frontend for converting data in the OMOP Common Data Model
    to the Medical Event Data Standard (MEDS) with 'OMOP_MEDS', and for
    running 'MEDS-DEV' tasks, models and evaluation on the result. CDM tables
    are exported from any DBI or 'DatabaseConnector' connection to Parquet,
    the Python tools are pinned through 'reticulate' and run as separate
    processes, and outputs come back to R as typed objects with aggregate
    summaries suitable for sharing in network studies.
License: Apache License (>= 2)
URL: https://github.com/rvandewater/rmeds
